cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived data, please cite the preprint in preferred-citation below."
title: "LTL331-NEPC scRNA-seq analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a longitudinal single-cell RNA-seq study of neuroendocrine
  transdifferentiation in the LTL331/R patient-derived xenograft (51,726 cells,
  8 timepoints, pre-castration to NEPC), covering WES/CNV, trajectory, RNA velocity,
  fate mapping, regulon, and clinical cross-cohort analyses.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/yenyilin/ltl331-nepc"
license: MIT
